{
 "_how_to_edit": [
  "Hashtags for every caption, without the #. Lowercase letters, digits and _ only.",
  "Each video gets captions.hashtags.count tags (config.yaml, default 5): 'broad' from broad, 'niche' from",
  "niche (pinned tags first), and the rest split between the topic (by_topic, then the topic's category) and",
  "a country in the video (country_tags, else the name with spaces removed). Pools rotate between videos.",
  "Tags in 'banned' (and any tag containing fyp, viral, explore, foryou, follow4follow, like4like, f4f or l4l)",
  "are never used, even if they are added to a pool by mistake."
